replace: command.extend(["--no-capture", "--test-threads", "4"].map(str::to_owned));
caught-by:
    perf_ab::tests::the_build_and_the_run_are_the_crates_ignored_perf_tests_one_at_a_time

[break] the-comparison-is-of-the-ci-profile
rule: A measurement is of an optimised build: the tests are built in the profile asked for, release unless dist.
file: xtask/src/perf_ab.rs
in: nextest_arguments
find: command.push(request.profile.clone());
replace: command.push("ci".to_owned());
caught-by:
    perf_ab::tests::the_build_and_the_run_are_the_crates_ignored_perf_tests_one_at_a_time

